# While spork 19 is off, a fork past the held lock is no ChainLock conflict
# (chainlock/chainlock.cpp:73-82) and becomes the active chain. Back on, the lock conflicts with
# it: the timer's enforcement, by a handler that never saw the spork off, walks back to the lock.
extend main 2
cl main@-0
spork off
fork 1 2
spork on
extend main 1
